<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-UMW HOLDINGS 6-MTH NET UP 69 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UMW HOLDINGS 6-MTH NET UP 69 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 156.66   vs	  92.70</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 59.2    vs	  35.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,120.65   vs     1,669.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   257.66   vs	 151.09</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  33.16   vs  less  18.25</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.98   vs	  nil</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	10.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - UMW Holdings Bhd is a vehicle distribution firm which holds the Toyota franchise in Malaysia.</p>
